					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13189610#post-4569613</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13189610/a-bold-choice#post-4569613</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2020 22:11:56 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>BlueJones</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4646198</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I enjoyed the fact that this type of recruitment for Foundation staff is quite different from the standard &quot;security/lab&quot; area and set in a Mormon church. I dare say it is rather refreshing to see this be different.</p> <p>As for the characters, I do love the interaction between Cal and David. It does leave a nice brotherly love while also showing what is happening with the family without being explicit about it.</p> <p>+1 from me</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
